1
00:01:30,480 --> 00:01:34,950
[AWAKEN]

2
00:01:35,600 --> 00:01:37,930
[Episode 10]

3
00:02:11,430 --> 00:02:12,890
The nerve of you to show up.

4
00:02:16,960 --> 00:02:18,220
Where did you take her?

5
00:02:22,000 --> 00:02:23,310
Is she already dead?

6
00:02:28,800 --> 00:02:30,310
Did you kill her?

7
00:02:32,560 --> 00:02:33,420
Say something!

8
00:02:42,980 --> 00:02:43,980
Raise your gun.

9
00:02:45,050 --> 00:02:45,800
Raise it!

10
00:02:59,360 --> 00:03:01,020
Are you going to shoot me dead?

11
00:03:08,470 --> 00:03:09,990
You don't even know how to shoot.

12
00:03:09,990 --> 00:03:11,870
You can't blow my head off with one shot.

13
00:03:11,870 --> 00:03:12,960
You can't protect yourself,

14
00:03:12,960 --> 00:03:14,490
yet you want to save others!

15
00:03:15,430 --> 00:03:16,310
Listen up.

16
00:03:16,560 --> 00:03:18,020
What's the use of a camera?

17
00:03:18,380 --> 00:03:21,440
Can it turn into a bullet
that pierces through my skull?

18
00:03:22,750 --> 00:03:23,430
Remember:

19
00:03:23,840 --> 00:03:24,910
she is a Communist.

20
00:03:25,680 --> 00:03:27,079
Stop thinking about her.

21
00:03:27,280 --> 00:03:28,030
Otherwise,

22
00:03:28,630 --> 00:03:31,230
I'll have to suspect
you're in league with her!

23
00:03:32,079 --> 00:03:32,750
Yes!

24
00:03:33,000 --> 00:03:33,800
I am!

25
00:03:34,240 --> 00:03:35,630
I'm in league with her!

26
00:03:36,160 --> 00:03:37,400
I'm also a Communist!

27
00:03:42,660 --> 00:03:45,520
There's no Communist
as stupid as you in this world.

28
00:04:00,190 --> 00:04:01,310
To me,

29
00:04:03,650 --> 00:04:05,510
whether she is a Communist or not,

30
00:04:06,470 --> 00:04:07,840
I don't care at all.

31
00:04:10,750 --> 00:04:11,610
In these times,

32
00:04:13,080 --> 00:04:15,480
aren't people's stances always changing?

33
00:04:17,940 --> 00:04:19,339
When I met you,

34
00:04:21,040 --> 00:04:22,970
you were protecting this country.

35
00:04:25,070 --> 00:04:25,830
Now,

36
00:04:28,720 --> 00:04:30,380
who is your gun protecting...

37
00:04:34,720 --> 00:04:35,920
and who is it aimed at?

38
00:04:40,800 --> 00:04:41,720
Right now,

39
00:04:42,800 --> 00:04:44,330
before saving the country,

40
00:04:45,950 --> 00:04:47,310
I have to save myself.

41
00:05:13,750 --> 00:05:14,800
Even God

42
00:05:16,830 --> 00:05:18,160
wouldn't believe that.

43
00:05:41,430 --> 00:05:42,960
Knowing Auntie for so long,

44
00:05:43,240 --> 00:05:45,370
how have I never taken a picture of her?

45
00:05:47,240 --> 00:05:49,120
Her picture wasn't taken,

46
00:05:50,890 --> 00:05:52,750
so why did she get sucked away too?

47
00:06:02,960 --> 00:06:05,160
Spring thunder roars, all things grow.

48
00:06:05,350 --> 00:06:08,390
Today is The Awakening of Insects,
the 20th of the first lunar month.

49
00:06:08,390 --> 00:06:09,680
What a splendid day.

50
00:06:10,310 --> 00:06:11,160
Get out.

51
00:06:15,600 --> 00:06:17,400
Women shouldn't be so stubborn.

52
00:06:19,800 --> 00:06:21,000
What you said,

53
00:06:22,920 --> 00:06:25,120
even the God of Thunder wouldn't agree.

54
00:06:35,190 --> 00:06:36,390
Have a safe trip.

55
00:06:36,720 --> 00:06:37,280
Get out!

56
00:06:46,800 --> 00:06:48,130
Then I'll take my leave.

57
00:06:49,130 --> 00:06:49,920
Remember:

58
00:06:50,560 --> 00:06:53,120
just stick with me
and you'll rise to the top

59
00:06:53,360 --> 00:06:55,560
and live the high life with fine dining.

60
00:06:58,830 --> 00:07:00,040
Fine dining?

61
00:07:01,070 --> 00:07:03,070
Is it as good as Yangzhou fried rice?

62
00:07:03,630 --> 00:07:04,390
Don't worry.

63
00:07:05,100 --> 00:07:07,500
There's plenty of Yangzhou fried rice too.

64
00:07:27,010 --> 00:07:28,210
Commendation Order,

65
00:07:28,480 --> 00:07:30,280
Order No. 195.

66
00:07:31,230 --> 00:07:32,760
Du Huangqiao of
the Special Operations Division

67
00:07:32,760 --> 00:07:35,000
of the National Military Council

68
00:07:35,450 --> 00:07:37,000
fought a fierce battle against the NBIS

69
00:07:37,000 --> 00:07:38,930
during the operation to eliminate

70
00:07:39,070 --> 00:07:40,800
the leaders of the 12th Branch.

71
00:07:41,140 --> 00:07:42,200
Calm and decisive,

72
00:07:42,460 --> 00:07:43,550
wise and brave,

73
00:07:44,260 --> 00:07:45,850
he thwarted the evil plots of the NBIS

74
00:07:45,850 --> 00:07:47,820
and boosted the prestige of our army.

75
00:07:47,820 --> 00:07:49,140
A special commendation is hereby issued

76
00:07:49,140 --> 00:07:50,200
as encouragement.

77
00:07:50,340 --> 00:07:51,950
Keep up the good work.

78
00:07:52,340 --> 00:07:53,140
Cleaner,

79
00:07:54,180 --> 00:07:55,180
welcome back.

80
00:08:06,900 --> 00:08:09,100
Only two bodies were found at the scene.

81
00:08:10,670 --> 00:08:11,990
Look around again! Now!

82
00:08:11,990 --> 00:08:12,900
Yes!

83
00:08:17,460 --> 00:08:19,460
Maybe after obtaining the address,

84
00:08:19,950 --> 00:08:22,070
that female Communist noticed something

85
00:08:22,070 --> 00:08:23,270
and a fight broke out.

86
00:08:23,360 --> 00:08:25,690
The scene was burned beyond recognition.

87
00:08:26,740 --> 00:08:28,920
Only two charred bodies were found.

88
00:08:32,270 --> 00:08:33,190
I don't believe

89
00:08:34,190 --> 00:08:35,820
two men couldn't even handle

90
00:08:35,820 --> 00:08:36,820
an injured woman.

91
00:08:38,500 --> 00:08:40,789
The men were sent by No. 76 in Hangzhou.

92
00:08:41,150 --> 00:08:42,620
They were personally trained

93
00:08:42,620 --> 00:08:45,150
by Lu Xiaoguang, a Communist

94
00:08:45,150 --> 00:08:46,550
who was recently turned.

95
00:08:46,820 --> 00:08:47,500
He dreams of

96
00:08:48,220 --> 00:08:50,020
being transferred to Shanghai.

97
00:08:50,390 --> 00:08:51,700
So he wouldn't have

98
00:08:52,460 --> 00:08:53,500
sent losers over.

99
00:08:56,390 --> 00:08:57,740
Maybe he messed up and fled,

100
00:08:57,740 --> 00:08:58,670
afraid of being

101
00:08:58,740 --> 00:08:59,800
held accountable.

102
00:09:05,340 --> 00:09:07,270
But I've been keeping an eye on him.

103
00:09:07,570 --> 00:09:09,500
Not a word will leak out.

104
00:09:13,860 --> 00:09:16,190
Although the Communist forces are small,

105
00:09:16,700 --> 00:09:18,910
their ability cannot be underestimated.

106
00:09:18,910 --> 00:09:21,270
The matter of the female Communist
is over.

107
00:09:21,270 --> 00:09:23,400
It doesn't matter if she's dead or not.

108
00:09:23,810 --> 00:09:25,060
But there's one thing

109
00:09:26,220 --> 00:09:28,020
that's been weighing on my mind.

110
00:09:29,620 --> 00:09:30,340
What is it?

111
00:09:32,190 --> 00:09:34,850
During the rescue operation
at Renji Hospital,

112
00:09:35,100 --> 00:09:37,230
two people from Operations also died.

113
00:09:38,100 --> 00:09:40,430
That was definitely not done by my people.

114
00:09:40,480 --> 00:09:41,320
So,

115
00:09:42,030 --> 00:09:44,230
the Communists were also
preparing a rescue operation.

116
00:09:44,230 --> 00:09:46,030
They were just a step behind you.

117
00:09:50,500 --> 00:09:51,430
You mean...

118
00:09:53,980 --> 00:09:55,430
we have a mole in No. 76?

119
00:09:59,790 --> 00:10:00,500
Mr. Zhao.

120
00:10:01,220 --> 00:10:01,910
Who?

121
00:10:02,430 --> 00:10:03,150
Zhao Qian.

122
00:10:05,070 --> 00:10:06,930
He caught the Communist himself.

123
00:10:08,420 --> 00:10:09,650
I sent him there.

124
00:10:10,860 --> 00:10:11,520
Look at you.

125
00:10:12,790 --> 00:10:14,620
You've been Cleaner for so long that

126
00:10:14,620 --> 00:10:16,350
you're unable to trust anyone.

127
00:10:19,100 --> 00:10:19,820
Indeed.

128
00:10:20,190 --> 00:10:21,740
It'd be horrifying if

129
00:10:22,310 --> 00:10:23,440
he were a Communist.

130
00:10:23,550 --> 00:10:24,500
To doubt our own,

131
00:10:24,860 --> 00:10:26,430
you need solid evidence.

132
00:10:27,230 --> 00:10:29,090
He and Su Men aren't the same kind.

133
00:10:36,070 --> 00:10:37,950
Su Men's your biggest worry.

134
00:10:38,860 --> 00:10:40,340
Just one word from you,

135
00:10:40,950 --> 00:10:43,010
and I can make her disappear anytime.

136
00:10:47,100 --> 00:10:48,560
It's good to have you back.

137
00:10:49,980 --> 00:10:51,550
In the current No. 76,

138
00:10:52,100 --> 00:10:54,430
there are fewer and fewer people to trust,

139
00:10:54,790 --> 00:10:55,980
and more and more

140
00:10:56,670 --> 00:10:57,700
eyes watching me.

141
00:10:59,580 --> 00:11:01,570
Well, there used to be Yu,
but it's a shame

142
00:11:01,570 --> 00:11:03,630
he turned out to be a disappointment.

143
00:11:04,860 --> 00:11:05,740
Has his ledger

144
00:11:06,580 --> 00:11:07,510
been dealt with?

145
00:11:13,910 --> 00:11:15,070
I had Yu Yingxiang

146
00:11:15,740 --> 00:11:17,600
take the ledger to the bathhouse.

147
00:11:20,030 --> 00:11:20,820
Kill him,

148
00:11:23,000 --> 00:11:24,460
and bring the ledger back.

149
00:11:32,360 --> 00:11:33,490
Where's the ledger?

150
00:11:35,390 --> 00:11:36,390
In the briefcase.

151
00:11:40,220 --> 00:11:42,790
Are you... seeing me off?

152
00:11:44,070 --> 00:11:44,620
Yes.

153
00:11:45,980 --> 00:11:48,040
I'll personally send you on your way.

154
00:12:34,070 --> 00:12:36,100
There were too many
prying eyes at Fairy Bath.

155
00:12:36,100 --> 00:12:37,630
I was worried I'd lose the ledger,

156
00:12:37,630 --> 00:12:38,630
so I destroyed it.

157
00:12:42,420 --> 00:12:43,750
Saving you back then was

158
00:12:44,950 --> 00:12:45,950
the right choice.

159
00:12:50,070 --> 00:12:51,550
You saved my life.

160
00:12:52,530 --> 00:12:53,500
If you want it,

161
00:12:53,780 --> 00:12:55,110
you can take it anytime.

162
00:13:03,070 --> 00:13:03,870
You're awake.

163
00:13:15,420 --> 00:13:17,990
My wife and daughter are dead.

164
00:13:20,870 --> 00:13:23,990
You should've let me die with them.

165
00:13:26,270 --> 00:13:28,000
It's the party-state you serve

166
00:13:28,500 --> 00:13:29,560
that abandoned you

167
00:13:30,430 --> 00:13:31,360
and your family.

168
00:14:17,790 --> 00:14:18,580
Look.

169
00:14:21,220 --> 00:14:22,680
The sun is so bright today.

170
00:14:27,620 --> 00:14:28,910
All that happened yesterday

171
00:14:28,910 --> 00:14:30,110
died with yesterday.

172
00:14:30,640 --> 00:14:31,900
All that happens today

173
00:14:31,950 --> 00:14:33,100
lives with today.

174
00:14:35,000 --> 00:14:37,600
The Du Huangqiao
who lived for the party-state

175
00:14:38,390 --> 00:14:39,550
died yesterday.

176
00:14:42,790 --> 00:14:43,980
The new Du Huangqiao

177
00:14:44,430 --> 00:14:45,100
should live

178
00:14:46,390 --> 00:14:47,720
for himself from now on.

179
00:14:53,790 --> 00:14:54,670
From today on,

180
00:14:55,790 --> 00:14:58,390
I, Du Huangqiao,
will not only live for myself,

181
00:14:59,910 --> 00:15:00,860
but also for you.

182
00:15:08,150 --> 00:15:09,950
I believe in your capabilities.

183
00:15:11,310 --> 00:15:13,510
And I believe in your loyalty even more.

184
00:15:17,980 --> 00:15:19,180
Now that you're back,

185
00:15:19,310 --> 00:15:20,770
what position do you want?

186
00:15:21,680 --> 00:15:24,080
I'll follow your arrangements, Director.

187
00:15:27,390 --> 00:15:28,420
Effective today,

188
00:15:29,070 --> 00:15:30,200
you'll take the post

189
00:15:30,270 --> 00:15:33,000
of Captain
of the Direct Action Brigade of No. 76.

190
00:15:43,100 --> 00:15:44,300
Thank you, Director.

191
00:15:46,430 --> 00:15:47,070
Director,

192
00:15:48,070 --> 00:15:49,930
I'd like to bring someone else in.

193
00:15:51,430 --> 00:15:52,070
Who?

194
00:15:52,740 --> 00:15:53,550
Chen Kailai.

195
00:15:54,500 --> 00:15:55,620
The photographer.

196
00:15:56,300 --> 00:15:57,370
What use could

197
00:15:58,070 --> 00:15:59,130
a photographer be?

198
00:16:00,070 --> 00:16:01,100
He saved my life,

199
00:16:01,150 --> 00:16:02,200
and I saved his.

200
00:16:02,950 --> 00:16:04,860
We've been through
life and death together.

201
00:16:04,860 --> 00:16:05,790
He's very smart.

202
00:16:06,430 --> 00:16:07,910
If I personally train him,

203
00:16:08,100 --> 00:16:10,390
he could become a pillar of No. 76.

204
00:16:12,330 --> 00:16:14,460
You can decide who you want to recruit.

205
00:16:14,530 --> 00:16:15,930
But before using anyone,

206
00:16:16,220 --> 00:16:18,620
you must vet their background thoroughly.

207
00:16:18,820 --> 00:16:19,910
Chen Kailai is

208
00:16:20,340 --> 00:16:21,550
very close to Su Men.

209
00:16:24,030 --> 00:16:26,490
That's exactly one of the reasons
I want him.

210
00:16:27,220 --> 00:16:27,910
Also,

211
00:16:30,070 --> 00:16:32,470
Cang Guanglian will be under your command.

212
00:16:32,550 --> 00:16:33,350
I know there's

213
00:16:33,780 --> 00:16:35,140
bad blood between you two,

214
00:16:35,140 --> 00:16:36,470
but you must understand

215
00:16:36,630 --> 00:16:39,230
that you're both my right-hand men.

216
00:16:41,910 --> 00:16:43,310
Rest assured, Director.

217
00:16:44,430 --> 00:16:45,470
Big or small,

218
00:16:46,430 --> 00:16:47,630
I know my priorities.

219
00:16:53,650 --> 00:16:54,450
Inspector Su.

220
00:16:58,370 --> 00:17:00,100
Captain Du, to think you'd even

221
00:17:00,440 --> 00:17:01,900
try to pull a fast one on me.

222
00:17:03,350 --> 00:17:04,150
Inspector Su,

223
00:17:04,950 --> 00:17:07,109
it's my fault.

224
00:17:07,740 --> 00:17:09,800
What I did behind the director's back

225
00:17:10,130 --> 00:17:11,660
accidentally got you hurt.

226
00:17:12,540 --> 00:17:13,869
Punish me as you see fit.

227
00:17:15,910 --> 00:17:17,710
What a loyal dog.

228
00:17:20,910 --> 00:17:22,950
At the entrance of Fairy Bath,

229
00:17:22,990 --> 00:17:25,140
there was a local dog named Yeller.

230
00:17:26,670 --> 00:17:29,260
We used to be quite close.

231
00:17:29,310 --> 00:17:31,040
Unfortunately, yesterday...

232
00:17:32,820 --> 00:17:34,350
I accidentally got it hurt.

233
00:17:36,910 --> 00:17:39,220
Then I hope you don't end up like it.

234
00:17:41,500 --> 00:17:44,100
Thank you for your forgiveness,
Inspector Su.

235
00:17:49,560 --> 00:17:51,090
This lousy stormy weather—

236
00:17:51,150 --> 00:17:52,550
it's going to rain again.

237
00:17:54,060 --> 00:17:54,950
The world is

238
00:17:55,220 --> 00:17:57,300
full of unpredictable twists and turns.

239
00:17:57,300 --> 00:17:58,500
When some succeed,

240
00:17:58,740 --> 00:18:00,980
others fail.

241
00:18:03,260 --> 00:18:04,920
If you're the one succeeding,

242
00:18:05,450 --> 00:18:07,450
then I must be the one failing.

243
00:18:09,320 --> 00:18:10,650
That's not what I meant.

244
00:18:12,190 --> 00:18:14,780
In the decades
since the fall of the Qing Dynasty,

245
00:18:14,780 --> 00:18:16,430
the rulers of this land have changed

246
00:18:16,430 --> 00:18:17,360
again and again.

247
00:18:17,580 --> 00:18:18,540
Today it's you.

248
00:18:18,950 --> 00:18:19,950
Tomorrow it's me.

249
00:18:21,350 --> 00:18:22,430
Who knows

250
00:18:23,220 --> 00:18:24,820
who will have the last laugh?

251
00:18:27,000 --> 00:18:29,260
Who do you think it will be, Inspector Su?

252
00:18:31,870 --> 00:18:34,630
Whoever lives the longest.

253
00:18:45,980 --> 00:18:47,510
Do what I said immediately.

254
00:18:47,820 --> 00:18:48,670
Rest assured, Director Li.

255
00:18:48,670 --> 00:18:49,020
Understood?

256
00:18:49,020 --> 00:18:49,780
Director Li.

257
00:18:49,950 --> 00:18:51,610
Director Li, nice to meet you.

258
00:18:54,670 --> 00:18:55,910
Congratulations.

259
00:18:56,880 --> 00:18:57,600
Congrats.

260
00:18:59,390 --> 00:19:01,470
Welcome back, Captain Du.

261
00:19:03,870 --> 00:19:06,000
Captain of the Direct Action Brigade.

262
00:19:08,350 --> 00:19:10,350
When it comes to being well-informed,

263
00:19:10,350 --> 00:19:11,960
it has to be you, Sachiko.

264
00:19:16,980 --> 00:19:19,980
You wiped out the 12th Branch of NBIS
in one fell swoop.

265
00:19:20,070 --> 00:19:22,350
You're now the favorite of No. 76.

266
00:19:24,850 --> 00:19:27,810
You also deserve some credit for this.

267
00:19:31,660 --> 00:19:32,920
I'm glad you remember.

268
00:19:33,580 --> 00:19:34,740
Of course I do.

269
00:19:35,540 --> 00:19:37,070
If it weren't for your help,

270
00:19:37,710 --> 00:19:40,220
how could I have gathered
the 12th Branch of NBIS

271
00:19:40,220 --> 00:19:41,820
all together?

272
00:19:55,540 --> 00:19:57,670
Sell this intel to the Hurricane Team.

273
00:20:04,630 --> 00:20:05,690
What is this place?

274
00:20:06,390 --> 00:20:08,590
The address of the Project Slumber lab.

275
00:20:08,910 --> 00:20:10,310
They definitely want it.

276
00:20:34,930 --> 00:20:36,930
From now on, I'll be

277
00:20:37,420 --> 00:20:39,180
counting on you at No. 76.

278
00:20:42,080 --> 00:20:42,880
Rest assured.

279
00:20:43,580 --> 00:20:45,050
As long as I'm here,

280
00:20:45,600 --> 00:20:47,800
I'll take good care of you.

281
00:20:50,760 --> 00:20:51,490
Thank you.

282
00:21:02,360 --> 00:21:03,220
A glass of wine.

283
00:21:10,520 --> 00:21:12,250
That blind man invited you too?

284
00:21:14,410 --> 00:21:15,560
I'm not here for him.

285
00:21:15,840 --> 00:21:17,410
He's riding high right now.

286
00:21:17,520 --> 00:21:19,600
You now have a backer at No. 76.

287
00:21:19,840 --> 00:21:20,600
Who cares?

288
00:21:22,800 --> 00:21:25,520
Mr. Zhao, you're really
smooth and tactful.

289
00:21:26,170 --> 00:21:27,930
You can make friends with anyone.

290
00:21:27,930 --> 00:21:30,040
The three of us have bathed together.

291
00:21:30,040 --> 00:21:31,170
It's a special bond.

292
00:21:31,800 --> 00:21:33,330
How about a nickname for us?

293
00:21:33,690 --> 00:21:35,620
The Three Heroes of the Bathhouse.

294
00:21:38,250 --> 00:21:39,930
That's a good nickname!

295
00:21:41,250 --> 00:21:42,580
What's so good about it?

296
00:21:43,360 --> 00:21:45,010
Fairy Bath's done anyway.

297
00:21:48,650 --> 00:21:49,450
Don't worry.

298
00:21:50,360 --> 00:21:51,650
I'll make sure

299
00:21:51,930 --> 00:21:54,190
the "Fairy Bath" sign stands tall again.

300
00:21:54,280 --> 00:21:55,450
The sign is still there.

301
00:21:55,450 --> 00:21:57,410
It's just a pity about the boss.

302
00:21:59,360 --> 00:22:00,560
She's already dead.

303
00:22:01,080 --> 00:22:02,880
What's the use of dwelling on it?

304
00:22:03,560 --> 00:22:04,760
Who would've thought

305
00:22:05,360 --> 00:22:08,070
that such a wonderful person
was actually from the NBIS?

306
00:22:08,070 --> 00:22:09,130
And none other than

307
00:22:09,160 --> 00:22:11,070
the renowned God of Wealth?

308
00:22:11,220 --> 00:22:12,620
And who would've thought

309
00:22:12,740 --> 00:22:14,390
that a blind man is actually...

310
00:22:14,390 --> 00:22:15,350
A traitor.

311
00:22:17,820 --> 00:22:18,540
Right?

312
00:22:23,830 --> 00:22:24,590
I know.

313
00:22:25,150 --> 00:22:26,830
You all think I was too heartless.

314
00:22:26,830 --> 00:22:27,980
But in this world,

315
00:22:27,980 --> 00:22:30,380
life forces everyone's hand at some point.

316
00:22:30,790 --> 00:22:32,190
She chose the wrong side,

317
00:22:32,630 --> 00:22:34,350
so death is her best ending.

318
00:22:34,790 --> 00:22:35,590
I understand.

319
00:22:36,070 --> 00:22:37,530
Letting her suffer less is

320
00:22:37,870 --> 00:22:39,830
also your way of looking out for her.

321
00:22:39,830 --> 00:22:40,560
Ridiculous.

322
00:22:41,940 --> 00:22:44,200
Killing someone is looking out for them?

323
00:22:44,310 --> 00:22:45,740
You lot are insane.

324
00:22:48,980 --> 00:22:50,780
I was like him when I was younger.

325
00:23:06,870 --> 00:23:09,460
Mr. Zhao, you've been sandbagging.

326
00:23:10,830 --> 00:23:12,830
You caught that female Communist.

327
00:23:13,460 --> 00:23:14,550
It was pure luck.

328
00:23:14,910 --> 00:23:18,570
Director Li specifically asked me
to make up the numbers that day.

329
00:23:19,460 --> 00:23:20,320
I realized that

330
00:23:21,940 --> 00:23:23,460
as long as it's about the Communists,

331
00:23:23,460 --> 00:23:26,220
you're particularly attentive.

332
00:23:27,260 --> 00:23:27,980
Wait.

333
00:23:28,660 --> 00:23:29,460
What's wrong?

334
00:23:29,830 --> 00:23:30,980
You reminded me.

335
00:23:30,980 --> 00:23:33,420
Why am I not included
in this batch of commendations?

336
00:23:33,420 --> 00:23:36,150
Could the credit have
all gone to Cang Guanglian?

337
00:23:36,310 --> 00:23:37,830
Li Moqun

338
00:23:39,630 --> 00:23:41,350
and Du the Blind...

339
00:23:46,980 --> 00:23:49,350
They teamed up to play me.

340
00:23:50,550 --> 00:23:52,350
One Yu Yingxiang wasn't enough.

341
00:23:52,980 --> 00:23:54,910
They even sent a female Communist.

342
00:23:58,040 --> 00:23:59,170
In all this,

343
00:23:59,830 --> 00:24:01,630
I'm the only fool,

344
00:24:01,630 --> 00:24:03,550
being played like a fiddle.

345
00:24:05,180 --> 00:24:06,870
Especially that Du the Blind,

346
00:24:07,640 --> 00:24:09,200
he's just a dog.

347
00:24:11,830 --> 00:24:12,740
Come on.

348
00:24:13,700 --> 00:24:15,590
Let's drink up today.

349
00:24:35,870 --> 00:24:37,180
May I have this dance?

350
00:24:39,220 --> 00:24:41,280
With your dancing skills? No thanks.

351
00:24:46,460 --> 00:24:47,660
What did you capture?

352
00:24:50,310 --> 00:24:51,440
My miserable state?

353
00:24:54,420 --> 00:24:56,280
I don't think you look miserable.

354
00:24:57,350 --> 00:24:59,010
Sometimes people look better

355
00:24:59,420 --> 00:25:00,680
when they don't smile.

356
00:25:04,330 --> 00:25:05,660
That's not a bad answer.

357
00:25:07,420 --> 00:25:09,020
Then can I ask you something?

358
00:25:16,460 --> 00:25:18,190
I know what you're going to ask.

359
00:25:19,500 --> 00:25:20,630
Is she really dead?

360
00:25:24,910 --> 00:25:26,710
It's already in the newspapers.

361
00:25:27,630 --> 00:25:29,830
Newspaper headlines change every day.

362
00:25:30,910 --> 00:25:31,910
But I believe

363
00:25:32,170 --> 00:25:32,930
your words.

364
00:25:40,220 --> 00:25:41,110
She's dead.

365
00:26:06,500 --> 00:26:07,430
What did she say?

366
00:26:09,500 --> 00:26:10,220
She's dead.

367
00:26:29,830 --> 00:26:31,690
The dead cannot come back to life.

368
00:26:33,260 --> 00:26:34,110
But we must

369
00:26:35,500 --> 00:26:37,160
keep the grudge in our hearts.

370
00:26:42,420 --> 00:26:43,420
It's all my fault.

371
00:27:12,460 --> 00:27:14,520
It's my fault that there isn't a photo

372
00:27:15,980 --> 00:27:16,830
of Auntie.

373
00:27:21,420 --> 00:27:22,830
It's also my fault

374
00:27:24,910 --> 00:27:26,040
that my cousin died.

375
00:27:37,310 --> 00:27:39,570
I shouldn't have trusted that blind man.

376
00:27:55,630 --> 00:27:56,660
Let's not cry.

377
00:28:01,020 --> 00:28:02,700
The living must live well.

378
00:28:04,740 --> 00:28:06,260
We must live well for them.

379
00:28:22,740 --> 00:28:24,420
Boss, Cang Guanglian's here.

380
00:28:24,500 --> 00:28:25,630
He's in your office.

381
00:28:28,980 --> 00:28:30,500
I told his fortune before.

382
00:28:30,940 --> 00:28:32,660
If he wants to live to 89,

383
00:28:32,980 --> 00:28:34,390
he must beware of people

384
00:28:34,390 --> 00:28:36,250
with "shu (tree)" in their names.

385
00:29:27,550 --> 00:29:28,880
I've lived my whole life

386
00:29:29,150 --> 00:29:30,610
with eyes that don't work.

387
00:29:33,420 --> 00:29:34,680
Battalion Commander,

388
00:29:35,070 --> 00:29:35,670
please...

389
00:29:36,540 --> 00:29:37,670
Please punish me.

390
00:29:40,590 --> 00:29:42,920
I wronged you in the past.

391
00:29:46,340 --> 00:29:49,580
That day, I rushed back
to the camp for reinforcements.

392
00:29:50,730 --> 00:29:52,730
But there was no one left in the camp.

393
00:29:53,840 --> 00:29:55,480
Everyone was afraid of death

394
00:29:55,830 --> 00:29:57,260
and ran away.

395
00:30:01,660 --> 00:30:02,660
Get up!

396
00:30:04,660 --> 00:30:05,390
Take it!

397
00:30:10,460 --> 00:30:11,180
Later,

398
00:30:12,180 --> 00:30:13,870
I took my gun to go save you.

399
00:30:16,110 --> 00:30:17,440
But as soon as I went out,

400
00:30:18,790 --> 00:30:20,260
I ran into the Japanese.

401
00:30:36,330 --> 00:30:37,590
Battalion Commander.

402
00:30:38,660 --> 00:30:40,630
I misunderstood you.

403
00:30:43,180 --> 00:30:44,440
Battalion Commander,

404
00:30:44,980 --> 00:30:47,110
from now on, whatever your orders are,

405
00:30:47,660 --> 00:30:50,110
I will never say no!

406
00:31:12,550 --> 00:31:14,660
What if I order you

407
00:31:16,420 --> 00:31:17,980
to swallow these right now?

408
00:31:21,770 --> 00:31:22,730
Swallow them!

409
00:31:41,390 --> 00:31:42,150
Buddy,

410
00:31:44,630 --> 00:31:46,700
if you make too big a deal out of this,

411
00:31:48,390 --> 00:31:50,260
you're insulting me.

412
00:31:51,100 --> 00:31:53,620
I was just joking with you.

413
00:31:55,220 --> 00:31:56,260
In this world,

414
00:31:56,940 --> 00:31:58,500
many things

415
00:31:58,910 --> 00:32:00,420
are just meant to be.

416
00:32:01,550 --> 00:32:04,150
Take us for example.

417
00:32:07,020 --> 00:32:07,940
We are

418
00:32:08,740 --> 00:32:11,870
brothers who braved death together
on the battlefield!

419
00:32:13,590 --> 00:32:14,790
What you need to do now

420
00:32:15,980 --> 00:32:17,500
is to forget everything

421
00:32:18,500 --> 00:32:20,940
about Nanjing and the bathhouse!

422
00:32:25,550 --> 00:32:28,500
It was all just a joke.

423
00:32:29,500 --> 00:32:30,460
Because

424
00:32:31,500 --> 00:32:34,180
life forces everyone's hand at some point.

425
00:32:36,070 --> 00:32:36,940
Am I right?

426
00:32:40,070 --> 00:32:41,870
Battalion Commander...

427
00:32:52,660 --> 00:32:53,340
Pal.

428
00:32:54,180 --> 00:32:55,980
I need you to do something for me.

429
00:32:56,470 --> 00:32:58,270
Commander, just give the order.

430
00:32:58,870 --> 00:32:59,870
Keep an eye on him.

431
00:33:30,070 --> 00:33:31,040
From now on,

432
00:33:32,020 --> 00:33:33,880
no one is to mention Auntie again.

433
00:33:35,390 --> 00:33:37,050
Isn't she like a sister to you?

434
00:33:40,700 --> 00:33:41,870
Only those who

435
00:33:42,160 --> 00:33:43,520
[Xiaoxian]

436
00:33:42,510 --> 00:33:43,370
forget the dead

437
00:33:43,740 --> 00:33:45,260
can go on living.

438
00:33:46,420 --> 00:33:47,180
You too.

439
00:34:03,410 --> 00:34:04,300
Du the Blind,

440
00:34:05,460 --> 00:34:07,320
don't shed crocodile tears here.

441
00:34:07,740 --> 00:34:08,739
It's disgusting.

442
00:34:15,139 --> 00:34:15,909
Wait.

443
00:34:19,139 --> 00:34:19,940
Take this.

444
00:34:23,580 --> 00:34:24,840
I have enough clothes.

445
00:34:26,909 --> 00:34:28,060
Enough for the photo studio,

446
00:34:28,060 --> 00:34:29,540
but not for No. 76.

447
00:34:31,540 --> 00:34:33,020
Why would I go to No. 76?

448
00:34:35,670 --> 00:34:36,909
I told you

449
00:34:37,500 --> 00:34:39,100
our hard times are over.

450
00:34:39,750 --> 00:34:42,500
Join me at No. 76 and live the high life.

451
00:34:44,870 --> 00:34:45,670
That's you.

452
00:34:47,100 --> 00:34:48,100
That shark tank

453
00:34:48,100 --> 00:34:49,580
is not a place for me.

454
00:34:50,500 --> 00:34:51,620
It's precisely

455
00:34:51,620 --> 00:34:53,060
because it's a shark tank

456
00:34:53,060 --> 00:34:53,790
that

457
00:34:53,980 --> 00:34:55,670
I need you there with me.

458
00:34:56,310 --> 00:34:56,980
Why?

459
00:34:58,710 --> 00:35:00,710
Because I can't trust anyone there.

460
00:35:01,980 --> 00:35:03,100
I only trust you.

461
00:35:04,400 --> 00:35:06,060
But I don't trust you anymore.

462
00:35:13,390 --> 00:35:14,620
You don't understand

463
00:35:15,020 --> 00:35:16,150
people or politics.

464
00:35:16,710 --> 00:35:18,710
You'll suffer in the outside world.

465
00:35:18,870 --> 00:35:19,870
Like I said,

466
00:35:20,830 --> 00:35:23,160
following the right person is important.

467
00:35:23,830 --> 00:35:25,060
And like I said,

468
00:35:26,670 --> 00:35:28,140
I'm just a photographer.

469
00:35:28,580 --> 00:35:29,840
I don't follow anyone.

470
00:35:32,500 --> 00:35:34,020
Think it over again.

471
00:35:41,750 --> 00:35:43,480
Unless you tie me up and take me.

472
00:35:45,620 --> 00:35:46,940
I'm a blind man

473
00:35:47,350 --> 00:35:48,610
who can tell fortunes.

474
00:35:49,390 --> 00:35:50,870
I foresee that one day,

475
00:35:51,940 --> 00:35:53,270
you'll come begging me.

476
00:35:56,540 --> 00:35:57,310
Impossible.

477
00:36:18,500 --> 00:36:19,560
Boss, you're back.

478
00:36:19,710 --> 00:36:21,310
Mr. Zhao sent someone to deliver this,

479
00:36:21,310 --> 00:36:23,570
saying it's to pay respects to Xiaoxian.

480
00:36:23,910 --> 00:36:26,040
People from No. 76 have no conscience.

481
00:36:26,350 --> 00:36:27,810
They're all accomplices.

482
00:36:28,140 --> 00:36:29,470
Get rid of it right away.

483
00:36:39,230 --> 00:36:40,190
The departed

484
00:36:40,910 --> 00:36:42,170
deserve remembrance.

485
00:36:43,230 --> 00:36:44,020
Put them in a vase.

486
00:36:44,020 --> 00:36:44,710
By the way,

487
00:36:44,980 --> 00:36:47,510
I left the newspaper you ordered
on the stand.

488
00:36:47,580 --> 00:36:48,460
Newspaper?

489
00:36:48,670 --> 00:36:49,420
The Shen Bao.

490
00:36:49,580 --> 00:36:51,380
The newsboy said you ordered it.

491
00:37:37,060 --> 00:37:37,710
Captain,

492
00:37:38,420 --> 00:37:41,100
Mr. Zhao either goes to the dance hall
or eats out.

493
00:37:41,100 --> 00:37:42,710
Except for different female companions,

494
00:37:42,710 --> 00:37:44,570
I haven't seen anything unusual.

495
00:37:45,380 --> 00:37:48,710
That Du guy is deliberately
making things difficult for me.

496
00:37:48,870 --> 00:37:51,020
He just gives me useless crap to do.

497
00:37:56,630 --> 00:37:57,760
Thank you, Mr. Zhao.

498
00:38:05,420 --> 00:38:06,420
Surnamed Su,

499
00:38:06,910 --> 00:38:07,790
cousin,

500
00:38:08,460 --> 00:38:09,870
aged 25,

501
00:38:10,260 --> 00:38:12,120
went missing in the bathhouse...

502
00:38:13,830 --> 00:38:17,670
No. 13, Yaoshuinong Shantytown,
South Bank of Suzhou Creek.

503
00:38:22,230 --> 00:38:22,980
Rickshaw!

504
00:38:25,390 --> 00:38:27,980
To Yaoshuinong Shantytown,
South Bank of Suzhou Creek.

505
00:38:27,980 --> 00:38:28,670
Okay, sir.

506
00:38:28,700 --> 00:38:29,410
Sit tight.

507
00:38:32,620 --> 00:38:33,310
Well...

508
00:38:38,100 --> 00:38:39,910
Mr. Zhao, what a coincidence.

509
00:38:40,390 --> 00:38:41,270
You came alone?

510
00:38:41,540 --> 00:38:42,670
Didn't bring a date?

511
00:38:43,240 --> 00:38:44,600
I'm not like you,

512
00:38:45,230 --> 00:38:46,760
having a date with a beauty.

513
00:38:47,980 --> 00:38:50,100
How can you come here without a date?

514
00:38:56,540 --> 00:38:58,190
Do you know Lillian?

515
00:38:58,750 --> 00:39:00,100
Now, she's the most sought-after
in all of Shanghai.

516
00:39:00,100 --> 00:39:01,700
I'll help you jump the queue.

517
00:39:02,060 --> 00:39:03,120
He's Captain Cang.

518
00:39:03,910 --> 00:39:05,870
Mr. Zhao and I are old friends.

519
00:39:06,630 --> 00:39:08,940
Mr. Zhao's friends are my friends.

520
00:39:12,310 --> 00:39:13,190
Miss Lillian,

521
00:39:13,980 --> 00:39:15,540
I've heard so much about you.

522
00:39:15,540 --> 00:39:16,390
Captain Cang,

523
00:39:16,740 --> 00:39:17,570
let's dance.

524
00:39:24,580 --> 00:39:25,940
Mr. Zhao, join us.

525
00:39:26,190 --> 00:39:27,110
You go have fun.

526
00:39:32,870 --> 00:39:33,910
I'll order some drinks.

527
00:39:33,910 --> 00:39:34,970
I'll be right back.

528
00:39:35,100 --> 00:39:36,030
I'll be waiting.

529
00:39:56,140 --> 00:39:56,790
Hello?

530
00:40:16,750 --> 00:40:21,120
♪ Rose, oh rose, most lovely ♪

531
00:40:21,160 --> 00:40:25,240
♪ Rose, oh rose, most ravishing ♪

532
00:40:25,480 --> 00:40:29,620
♪ Blooming upon branches
through long summer days ♪

533
00:40:29,640 --> 00:40:33,880
♪ Rose, oh rose, I love you ♪

534
00:40:33,900 --> 00:40:38,440
♪ Rose, oh rose, your sentiment profound ♪

535
00:40:37,310 --> 00:40:38,500
How dare you, Cang Guanglian!

536
00:40:38,460 --> 00:40:42,090
♪ Rose, oh rose, your affection deep ♪

537
00:40:38,580 --> 00:40:39,750
Didn't you say you had a mission?

538
00:40:39,750 --> 00:40:41,390
So you came here for this vixen!

539
00:40:41,390 --> 00:40:42,350
No, no.

540
00:40:42,350 --> 00:40:42,940
Stop right there!

541
00:40:42,510 --> 00:40:46,640
♪ Blooming through the summer
amid the thorns ♪

542
00:40:43,790 --> 00:40:44,790
I really have a mission.

543
00:40:44,790 --> 00:40:46,460
You lied to me again! Move!

544
00:40:46,710 --> 00:40:48,910
Who the hell are you? Where are you from?

545
00:40:46,810 --> 00:40:50,880
♪ Rose, oh rose, I love you ♪

546
00:40:49,470 --> 00:40:50,350
What's your name?

547
00:40:50,350 --> 00:40:51,350
Let me look at you!

548
00:40:51,370 --> 00:40:55,410
♪ The vow of the heart,
the devotion of the soul ♪

549
00:40:51,420 --> 00:40:52,720
Let them handle their family affairs.

550
00:40:52,720 --> 00:40:53,500
We'll just dance.

551
00:40:53,500 --> 00:40:54,870
Why were you dancing with him?

552
00:40:54,870 --> 00:40:55,980
Alright, alright!

553
00:40:55,560 --> 00:40:59,230
♪ A sacred radiance
illuminates the earth ♪

554
00:40:55,980 --> 00:40:57,100
Let's go home. We'll talk at home.

555
00:40:57,100 --> 00:40:58,230
What home?

556
00:40:58,230 --> 00:40:59,490
Let's go home. Come on!

557
00:40:59,760 --> 00:41:03,790
♪ The vow of the heart,
the devotion of the soul ♪

558
00:41:01,140 --> 00:41:02,100
Let go of me!

559
00:41:03,670 --> 00:41:04,540
Let go!

560
00:41:03,960 --> 00:41:08,440
♪ A sacred radiance
illuminates the earth ♪

561
00:41:09,380 --> 00:41:13,720
♪ Rose, oh rose, slender are your stems ♪

562
00:41:09,940 --> 00:41:11,230
Cang told me a couple of days ago

563
00:41:11,230 --> 00:41:12,830
that he wanted to ask you out.

564
00:41:13,100 --> 00:41:13,910
Maybe he followed us

565
00:41:13,750 --> 00:41:17,470
♪ Rose, oh rose, sharp are your thorns ♪

566
00:41:13,910 --> 00:41:15,310
here on purpose today.

567
00:41:17,640 --> 00:41:19,310
No wonder you paired him up

568
00:41:18,010 --> 00:41:22,140
♪ Wind and rain may come to ravage today ♪

569
00:41:19,310 --> 00:41:20,370
with that Lillian.

570
00:41:21,540 --> 00:41:22,750
Don't worry, Mr. Zhao.

571
00:41:22,160 --> 00:41:26,630
♪ Bruising the tender twigs
and dainty petals ♪

572
00:41:23,190 --> 00:41:23,980
To me,

573
00:41:24,500 --> 00:41:26,100
you'll always be number one.

574
00:41:26,660 --> 00:41:30,390
♪ Rose, oh rose, steadfast is your heart ♪

575
00:41:26,940 --> 00:41:28,140
I don't believe that.

576
00:41:28,580 --> 00:41:29,790
Your acting's so good

577
00:41:29,790 --> 00:41:31,230
that you even fooled
that female Communist.

578
00:41:30,410 --> 00:41:34,740
♪ Rose, oh rose,
piercing are your prickles ♪

579
00:41:31,790 --> 00:41:33,790
It's a pity you didn't see
my performance that day

580
00:41:33,790 --> 00:41:34,870
