584
00:41:41,710 --> 00:41:42,980
How did you do it?

585
00:41:43,390 --> 00:41:44,670
I've never seen anyone

586
00:41:44,670 --> 00:41:46,330
who could imitate her so well.

587
00:41:46,500 --> 00:41:50,700
♪ Rose, oh rose, most lovely ♪

588
00:41:46,830 --> 00:41:48,360
Who said I haven't seen her?

589
00:41:48,830 --> 00:41:51,100
General Kagesa arranged for me to see her

590
00:41:50,930 --> 00:41:54,960
♪ Rose, oh rose, most ravishing ♪

591
00:41:51,100 --> 00:41:52,580
at the Plum Blossom Agency.

592
00:41:52,580 --> 00:41:53,420
Otherwise,

593
00:41:54,310 --> 00:41:55,390
I wouldn't have been able to

594
00:41:55,310 --> 00:41:59,260
♪ Blooming upon branches
through long summer days ♪

595
00:41:55,390 --> 00:41:58,720
replicate the elegant temperament
of that Shanghai woman.

596
00:41:59,310 --> 00:42:01,140
There aren't many elegant women
left in Shanghai.

597
00:41:59,370 --> 00:42:03,620
♪ Rose, oh rose, I love you ♪

598
00:42:02,140 --> 00:42:03,540
It's a pity for her to die.

599
00:42:03,860 --> 00:42:07,880
♪ Rose, oh rose, your sentiment profound ♪

600
00:42:05,420 --> 00:42:07,620
I doubt the Japanese would kill her.

601
00:42:07,900 --> 00:42:11,940
♪ Rose, oh rose, your affection deep ♪

602
00:42:09,310 --> 00:42:11,170
She comes from a powerful family.

603
00:42:11,870 --> 00:42:13,350
Her father does business in Japan.

604
00:42:12,410 --> 00:42:16,580
♪ Blooming through the summer
amid the thorns ♪

605
00:42:14,500 --> 00:42:16,500
I heard his business is quite large.

606
00:42:16,600 --> 00:42:20,760
♪ Rose, oh rose, I love you ♪

607
00:42:16,870 --> 00:42:19,330
The Japanese are still
somewhat wary of him.

608
00:42:20,420 --> 00:42:21,870
Is she still at the Plum Blossom Agency?

609
00:42:21,030 --> 00:42:25,310
♪ The vow of the heart,
the devotion of the soul ♪

610
00:42:22,620 --> 00:42:25,980
You seem to be very interested in her.

611
00:42:25,340 --> 00:42:29,410
♪ A sacred radiance
illuminates the earth ♪

612
00:42:26,980 --> 00:42:29,190
I figured she must be very beautiful,

613
00:42:29,440 --> 00:42:33,510
♪ The vow of the heart,
the devotion of the soul ♪

614
00:42:30,500 --> 00:42:32,900
or they wouldn't have
asked you to play her.

615
00:42:33,910 --> 00:42:37,920
♪ A sacred radiance
illuminates the earth ♪

616
00:42:34,500 --> 00:42:36,540
You sure know how to
catch people off guard

617
00:42:36,540 --> 00:42:38,400
with those compliments of yours.

618
00:42:39,240 --> 00:42:43,650
♪ Rose, oh rose, slender are your stems ♪

619
00:42:51,720 --> 00:42:52,710
Sir, stop here.

620
00:42:57,020 --> 00:42:57,680
Here you go.

621
00:42:58,230 --> 00:42:59,020
Thank you, sir.
